Significant changes from the upstream template
----------------------------------------------

The chat product the template exists to provide has been removed in its
entirety — the conversation UI, the AI SDK integration and every model
provider, the document/artifact/suggestion/vote features, the resumable
stream infrastructure, and the eight database tables behind them. Guardian
calls no language model and holds no conversation.

What remains in its place is a fleet reporting console: an ingest endpoint
that receives signed-in-machine reports from the `codegate` agent, a derived
finding lifecycle, per-machine authentication tokens, and the operator
console that displays them.

Files with material upstream lineage at the time of writing:

  lib/db/migrations/0000_initial.sql   the template's original schema, kept so
                                       migration history stays replayable
  app/globals.css                      Tailwind layer and theme scaffolding
  biome.jsonc                          linter configuration
  playwright.config.ts                 end-to-end test configuration
  next.config.ts                       framework configuration
  app/(auth)/                          Auth.js credentials-provider structure
